abstract: >-
  Replication package for the Agricultural Economics manuscript evaluating
  India's Operation Greens with a Double Machine Learning difference-in-differences
  design on daily Agmarknet mandi prices (2013-2024): scripts, derived panels,
  estimation results, and figures.
